##
## directory: dependencies and build output
##
/node_modules
/.svelte-kit
/build
/.vite

##
## directory: source that a broader rule would otherwise swallow
##
## The repository root ignores any directory named `cache` at any depth, which
## is aimed at build caches. `src/lib/cache` is source code, so it is put back
## here. A rule in this file wins over the root one for paths under this stack.
##
!/src/lib/cache/

##
## file: tooling state
##
*.tsbuildinfo
vite.config.ts.timestamp-*
npm-debug.log*

##
## file: local environment
##
.env
.env.*
